# models/
# This folder will contain all Mongoose schema and model definitions.
# Models are added in Phase 2 and beyond.
#
# Planned models (Phase 2+):
#   User.js           - User account schema (name, email, password, role)
#   Admin.js          - Admin account schema (or extended role in User)
#   Team.js           - Team member schema
#   Gallery.js        - Gallery item schema (image, caption, cloudinaryId)
#   Achievement.js    - Achievement schema (title, description, date, image)
#   Contact.js        - Contact form submission schema
#   HomeContent.js    - CMS schema for home page sections
#   Event.js          - Event schema
#   Sponsor.js        - Sponsor application schema
#   JoinApplication.js- Join team application schema
#   Notification.js   - Notification schema
